    "interconnection": "Both lifts and the optical shutter share one landing relay. Raising the near lift lowers the far dock and blocks the receiver; landing on that far dock reverses all three after the mirror is prepared. The hinge is first climbed and then crossed both ways as a bridge. The same Home spring launches toward the two different lower destinations before and after the circuit is solved.",
